## 2.1 Redis

Đã có:

```text
RedisModule
RedisService
```

Hỗ trợ:

```ts
set()

get()

exists()

del()

onModuleDestroy()
```

Dùng:

```text
Cache conversation
Cache user
Presence
Future session
```

---

## 2.2 Queue (BullMQ)

Đã có:

```text
QueueConfig

MessageQueue

MediaQueue
```

Queue:

```text
message

media
```

Đã sửa sang:

```text
ConfigService

không dùng process.env
```

---

## 2.3 Socket + Redis Adapter

Đã có:

```text
ChatGateway

SocketListener

RedisIoAdapter
```

Flow:

```text
